  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/6d4178fc-5bf0-41ed-9ec3-0718816df7e8-image.png\" style=\"width: 210px; height: 159px;\" /><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#956;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#38;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#956;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></math> are in parallel.<br /><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/db201b52-a1a1-4151-8296-790b91511231-image.png\" style=\"width: 240px; height: 183px;\" /><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi></math>&nbsp;The equivalent capacitance of the series combination is,&nbsp;<math><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>eq</mi></mrow></msub></math> is<math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>. So, the total charge supplied by the battery is,&nbsp;<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>&#8658;</mtext><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">Q</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>C</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>.<math><mo>&#8756;</mo></math>&nbsp;The potential difference across the parallel combination of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>&#956;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></math> is,&nbsp;<math><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>. So charge on <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></math> capacitor is,&nbsp;<math><msub><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>C</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>E</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>E</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>E</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>&rArr; So the graph is a hyperbola. With downward curve line. i.e.<br /><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/cef713cf-7e74-4ac0-ac52-6f9d2b6e903d-image.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 137px;\" /><p>&nbsp;</p>",
